6
00:00:25,000 --> 00:00:27,000
punch that bastard for me!

7
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:32,000
Yeah, I got this.

8
00:00:34,000 --> 00:00:36,000
Sorry, Master,

9
00:00:36,000 --> 00:00:39,000
