he could have noticed.

44
00:05:59,000 --> 00:06:01,000
[tires screeching]

45
00:06:01,000 --> 00:06:03,000
I have to survive.

46
00:06:06,000 --> 00:06:08,000
What happened
during our encounter

47
00:06:08,000 --> 00:06:10,000
that aroused his suspicion?

48
00:06:11,000 --> 00:06:14,000
Was there something off
about my imitation of Flutter?

49
00:06:16,000 --> 00:06:17,000
There must have been.

50
00:06:23,000 --> 00:06:25,000
but he didn't want to question me
right then and there,

51
00:06:25,000 --> 00:06:27,000
because the evidence against me

52
00:06:27,000 --> 00:06:29,000
wasn't conclusive enough
to warrant an accusation.

53
00:06:37,000 --> 00:06:39,000
That's why he's come down here,

54
00:06:39,000 --> 00:06:42,000
to see if his doubts were accurate.

55
00:06:44,000 --> 00:06:47,000
Was it trivial enough
that I can talk my way out of this,

56
00:06:47,000 --> 00:06:48,000
or was it so serious

57
00:06:55,000 --> 00:06:56,000
I should assume the worst.

58
00:06:57,000 --> 00:06:59,000
[Flutter's voice]
Is there anyone here?

59
00:07:09,000 --> 00:07:11,000
or I'm dead meat.

60
00:07:18,000 --> 00:07:21,000
Sinker Belle, if you're here,

61
00:07:21,000 --> 00:07:23,000
I need you to come
with me at once!

62
00:07:24,000 --> 00:07:26,000
[narrator] In reality,

63
00:07:33,000 --> 00:07:35,000
proving that he was a trusted ally.

64
00:07:38,000 --> 00:07:41,000
Why didn't you respond
when I called out?

65
00:07:41,000 --> 00:07:42,000
Where did everyone else go?

66
00:07:42,000 --> 00:07:44,000
[woman] I'm sorry.

67
00:07:44,000 --> 00:07:46,000
I don't know anything
about what's happening outside.

68
00:07:47,000 --> 00:07:49,000
The director says
that I can't speak to anyone,

69
00:07:50,000 --> 00:07:52,000
and that I'm only
ever allowed to talk to him.

70
00:07:53,000 --> 00:07:55,000
[narrator] It was obvious
that she thought this restriction

71
00:08:00,000 --> 00:08:03,000
All of the other women
thought the same thing.

72
00:08:04,000 --> 00:08:06,000
A messenger didn't make sense,

73
00:08:06,000 --> 00:08:07,000
because there was
a direct phone line

74
00:08:08,000 --> 00:08:09,000
that Bizeff used to contact them.

75
00:08:17,000 --> 00:08:19,000
and to continue following orders.

76
00:08:19,000 --> 00:08:21,000
Convinced that failing this test

77
00:08:21,000 --> 00:08:23,000
would be unacceptable
to the director,

78
00:08:23,000 --> 00:08:26,000
