neither the time nor energy.

81
00:08:48,000 --> 00:08:49,000
[gasps]

82
00:08:49,000 --> 00:08:51,000
[Ikalgo] There. Nen writing.

83
00:09:20,000 --> 00:09:23,000
but even so, he could not
shake the persistent feeling

84
00:09:23,000 --> 00:09:25,000
that he had lost a part of himself.

85
00:09:29,000 --> 00:09:30,000
[Ikalgo] Palm.

86
00:09:32,000 --> 00:09:34,000
If Palm got herself killed

87
00:09:34,000 --> 00:09:36,000
or something else
has taken her out of commission,

88
00:09:36,000 --> 00:09:39,000
use the Satellite Dragonflies
and your telepathy

89
00:09:39,000 --> 00:09:41,000
to provide backup to the Ants.

90
00:09:41,000 --> 00:09:43,000
Got it?

91
00:09:43,000 --> 00:09:44,000
Yeah, I got it.

92
00:09:44,000 --> 00:09:47,000
Just pretend
you're reporting to your superior,

93
00:09:47,000 --> 00:09:50,000
