informing Meleoron instead.

94
00:09:50,000 --> 00:09:52,000
You want me to feed them all lies

95
00:09:53,000 --> 00:09:54,000
so that we can throw them off?

96
00:09:54,000 --> 00:09:57,000
Yeah, and it's vitally important.

97
00:09:57,000 --> 00:09:58,000
I'm counting on you.

98
00:10:00,000 --> 00:10:03,000
[Ikalgo] That'll only work
assuming Meleoron and I

99
00:10:03,000 --> 00:10:05,000
haven't been found out
to be double agents yet.

100
00:10:06,000 --> 00:10:09,000
And since Bloster
is already suspicious of me,

101
00:10:09,000 --> 00:10:12,000
I've gotta do something about it.

102
00:10:12,000 --> 00:10:14,000
I have to take him out!

103
00:10:23,000 --> 00:10:25,000
Huh?

104
00:10:34,000 --> 00:10:37,000
Hey! Did you finish
your job from Hagya?

105
00:10:37,000 --> 00:10:39,000
[Flutter's voice] Yeah.
I guess you could say that.

106
00:10:40,000 --> 00:10:42,000
[Bloster] Hagya, huh?

107
00:10:43,000 --> 00:10:44,000
Huh?

108
00:10:44,000 --> 00:10:47,000
I could have sworn
he got mad when we called him that.

109
00:10:47,000 --> 00:10:48,000
[gasps]

110
00:10:48,000 --> 00:10:51,000
[tense music playing]

111
00:10:51,000 --> 00:10:53,000
[shudders]

112
00:11:42,000 --> 00:11:44,000
[suspenseful music playing]

113
00:11:49,000 --> 00:11:51,000
[Ikalgo] They think the suspect's dead.

114
00:11:52,000 --> 00:11:55,000
Once Bloster informs the others
of what he saw,

115
00:11:56,000 --> 00:11:58,000
I'll be able to move around freely.

116
00:11:59,000 --> 00:12:04,000
But still, I had no idea
that Hagya had changed his name.

117
00:12:19,000 --> 00:12:21,000
If I end up
crossing paths with them,

118
00:12:21,000 --> 00:12:23,000
I've gotta come up
with a better excuse.

119
00:12:25,000 --> 00:12:27,000
No. That won't work.

120
00:12:28,000 --> 00:12:31,000
Bloster didn't waste time
asking questions before he attacked.

121
00:12:31,000 --> 00:12:34,000
Anyone who doesn't know
what Hagya's new name is,

122
