in the middle of my punch.

180
00:18:02,000 --> 00:18:04,000
Hold on.

181
00:18:05,000 --> 00:18:06,000
Wait.

182
00:18:06,000 --> 00:18:09,000
Isn't this that thing they talk about,

183
00:18:18,000 --> 00:18:21,000
