He stopped swelling midway through!

186
00:18:32,000 --> 00:18:33,000
[chuckles]

187
00:18:35,000 --> 00:18:37,000
[Knuckle] He got me.
This whole time,

188
00:18:37,000 --> 00:18:40,000
